Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1728234}
Reviewed-on: https://codereview.qt-project.org/c/qt/qtwebengine-chromium/+/785333
Reviewed-by: Allan Sandfeld Jensen <allan.jensen@qt.io>
